       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nMetformin 1700 mg three times daily is 5,100 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum of 2,550 mg/day (immediate-release), and a dose that high raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals** (2,550 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1,700 mg/day total**, for example 850 mg PO twice daily with meals\n\nIf 1,700 mg three times daily is intended, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that you confirmed it. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and I'll enter it right away."
